              "fill": "#9B9B9B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 920,
              "content": "A team lived in three dialogs: one to manage templates, one to edit a template, one to deploy. You had to know all three existed and in what order. It is the same screen as a single agent with the switch flipped: the members are a table you can read across, so you can see at a glance that two of them are on the same model and one has no worktree, which is the mistake this replaces.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
