              "width": 760,
              "content": "Six controls that used to be spread over three of the four steps. None of them is needed to start an agent, and all of them matter once you know what you are doing, so they sit behind one row that reads out its own contents. The collapsed row is the summary, so nothing here is hidden, only folded.",
